Hi all,

We=E2=80=99re looking forward to welcoming you to Brown tomorrow for IIC!

Your travel tickets should have reached your inbox by now. Please check your =
inbox and spam folder. If you haven=E2=80=99t received your tickets, or if an=
y of the details look incorrect, please reply to this email as soon as possib=
le so we can help before you travel. If you=E2=80=99re traveling by car, this=
 ticket reminder does not apply.

Hotel check-in
The Graduate
11 Dorrance Street, Providence, RI 02903
Thursday, November 5 at 12:00 PM (noon) ET

If you arrive before noon, please hang around in the hotel lobby until check-=
in. We=E2=80=99ll have an IIC team member standing by at the hotel to welcome=
 you and help with any questions.

Please bring your student ID for check-in and a government-issued ID for trav=
el.

If you run into any issues or delays on the way, please let us know. See you =
tomorrow!

Best,
The IIC Team

